Package: cartiflette
Type: Package
Title: Official French Borders for Geographic Data Analytics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lino", "Galiana", email = "lino.galiana@insee.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Thomas", "Grandjean", email = "thomas.grandjean@developpement-durable.gouv.fr", role = "aut"),
    person("Alica", "Burlot", email = "alica.burlot@developpement-durable.gouv.fr", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Downloads the official French borders (IGN ADMIN EXPRESS COG
    CARTO, enriched with Insee metadata) published by the cartiflette project:
    communes, municipal arrondissements, IRIS, departements, regions and Insee
    zonings, with or without the overseas departements brought closer to
    metropolitan France. The GeoParquet files are read with DuckDB, which only
    downloads the requested polygons.
URL: https://github.com/InseeFrLab/cartiflette-r, https://inseefrlab.github.io/cartiflette/
BugReports: https://github.com/InseeFrLab/cartiflette-r/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    curl,
    DBI,
    duckdb (>= 1.5.0),
    jsonlite,
    sf
Suggests:
    dbplyr,
